{"version":1,"content":"<p>女星楊穎（Angelababy）及內地男星鄧超曾在綜藝節目《奔跑吧》中組成「叔姪組合」，兩人的搞笑互動深受觀眾喜愛。</p><p>昨日有網民在重慶偶遇他們，據悉是在錄製一檔公益微綜藝。</p><p>兩人相隔多年再於工作場合同框，迅速引爆熱議，網民直呼：「夢回跑男！</p><p>」&amp;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T16:21:50.418594+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T16:01:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T16:18:22.983942+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T16:18:22.983942+00:00","content_hash":"c48f6594b57303c1a115b7b42363f3face65f8db03db4c5f9704f575a89997de","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}